# Prediction declared wrongly: a predicted system writes a replicated
# component that is not predicted.
program movers.kest

component 0d3f8a3e-7c55-4b8e-9d0e-2a61f3c4b5a1 movers.position Position
component 5b1c9e22-4f07-4d3a-8c6b-91e7d2a0f4c8 movers.velocity Velocity

system movers.integrate simulation integrate write movers.position read movers.velocity predicted
system movers.bounce simulation bounce read movers.position write movers.velocity after movers.integrate predicted

replicate movers.position movers.velocity
player movers.position movers.velocity
input movers.velocity
predict movers.position
